abstract: >
  MouseScope is a modular desktop platform for practical mouse behavioral
  video analysis. Version 2.2.0 supports Tail Suspension Test (TST), Forced
  Swim Test (FST), Open Field Test (OFT), Novel Object Recognition (NOR),
  Elevated Plus Maze (EPM), and Y-Maze in one unified workflow with visual
  setup, batch workspace, result export, and bilingual reporting.
